<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Golf-Australian Masters final round scores.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Golf-Australian Masters final round scores.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading final scores in the Australian Masters golf tournament at the par-73 Huntingdale course on Sunday (Australian unless stated)</p>
<p>276: Peter Lonard 69 69 69 69, Peter O'Malley 65 66 73 72</p>
<p>(Lonard won on second play-off hole)</p>
<p>277 Shane Tait 68 67 74 68, Wayne Grady 70 67 69 71</p>
<p>278 Lucas Parsons 64 67 74 73</p>
<p>279 Mike Weir (Canada) 67 72 70 70</p>
<p>282 Robert Allenby 70 66 70 76</p>
<p>283 Larry Mize (U.S.) 68 70 72 73, Rodger Davis 72 65 72 74,</p>
<p>Tiger Woods (U.S.) 68 70 72 73</p>
<p>284 Andrew Bonhomme 70 75 70 69, Leith Wastle 71 69 73 71,</p>
<p>Lyndsay Stephen 73 69 72 70, Simon Owen (New Zealand) 68 72 73</p>
<p>71, Steve Alker (New Zealand) 72 70 73 69</p>
<p>285 Grant Moorhead (New Zealand) 69 75 72 69</p>
<p>286 Rick Gibson (Canada) 67 68 77 74, Steven Conran 70 75 68</p>
<p>73, Brett Patridge 70 71 71 74</p>
<p>287 Peter Senior 69 68 74 76, Shigenori Mori (Japan) 71 71 70</p>
<p>75, Craig Parry 73 70 70 74, Rodney Pampling 73 71 69 74, David</p>
<p>Ecob 71 68 76 72, Kenny Druce 70 71 77 69, Marcus Wheelhouse</p>
<p>(New Zealand) 69 74 75 69, Michael Clayton 70 73 73 71</p>
<p>288 Geoff Ogilvy 73 72 72 71, Jay Townsend (U.S.) 73 70 75 70,</p>
<p>Scott Laycock 73 69 74 72, Shane Robinson 69 72 75 72, Richard</p>
<p>Green 70 75 71 72, Stephen Allan 70 74 72 72, Doug Dunakey</p>
<p>(U.S.) 68 72 72 76</p>
